OL,3,AKing warns malicious online actors are
OL,4,Aevolving tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III has warned of the
OL,7,Fchallenges disinformation and other
OL,8,F"hostile online activity" pose to trust
OL,9,Fand security in the digital age.
OL,11,FThe comments, made in a letter to the
OL,12,FNational Cyber Security Centre (NCSC)
OL,13,Fto mark its 10th anniversary, spoke of
OL,14,F"malicious actors" continuing to
OL,15,F"evolve their tactics by using
OL,16,Fautomated technologies".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
