OL,3,AVolunteer police chief fired after
OL,4,APalantir probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FCdr Pete Stevens said: "SCO Deller
OL,7,Ffailed to meet that bar. His actions
OL,8,Fwere an abuse of the trust put in him
OL,9,Fand it is right that he is no longer
OL,10,Fable to serve in policing."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
