OL,3,ASeveral injured in attack on airport in
OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been injured in
OL,7,Fanother attack on an international
OL,8,Fairport in the Saudi capital Riyadh,
OL,9,Fauthorities say, days after Yemen's
OL,10,FHouthis claimed to have carried out
OL,11,Fsimilar strikes on the hub.
OL,13,FOperations at King Khalid International
OL,14,FAirport in Riyadh were suspended on
OL,15,FSaturday after the attack, the Saudi
OL,16,FCivil Aviation Authority said in a
OL,17,Fstatement.
OL,19,FMore than a dozen ambulances were seen
OL,20,Frushing to the airport, according to
OL,21,Fnews agency Reuters, citing an
OL,22,Feyewitness.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
