OL,3,AUS murderer Christa Pike discharged
OL,4,Afrom hospital 10 days after failed
OL,5,Aexecution
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS death row inmate Christa Pike has
OL,8,Fbeen discharged from hospital following
OL,9,Fher botched execution at the end of
OL,10,Flast month, her lawyers have said.
OL,12,FPike, 50, has been sent back to the
OL,13,Fprison where she has spent the last 30
OL,14,Fyears and is continuing to receive
OL,15,Fmedical care, according to a statement
OL,16,Ffrom her lawyers on Saturday.
OL,18,FShe survived two lethal injections of
OL,19,Fthe drug pentobarbital on 30 September,
OL,20,Fwhich left her in a critical condition.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
